{"id":"c31bd52a486b22ef","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-set12-range-factorization.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Range Factorization","display":"df-zfc-set12-range-factorization — ZFC Set12 Range Factorization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-range-factorization","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-range-factorization"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-range-factorization — ZFC Set12 Range Factorization","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-range]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-range-factorization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-range-factorization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-range-factorization — ZFC Set12 Range Factorization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" href=\"?note=9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-range\">58-df-zfc-rel-range</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in V\">\\(f,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RangeFactorization}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RangeFactorization}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}range\\text{-}factorization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RangeFactorization}_S(g,f)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B,R,i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(R,f)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,A,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;g(x)=f(x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,R,B)\n\\land\\forall y\\in R\\;i(y)=y\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;f(x)=i(g(x))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}range\\text{-}factorization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RangeFactorization}_S(g,f)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B,R,i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(R,f)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,A,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;g(x)=f(x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,R,B)\n\\land\\forall y\\in R\\;i(y)=y\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;f(x)=i(g(x))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The factorization equation is stated pointwise using the two registered function graphs; it no longer depends on an undeclared composition operator.  Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> is the corestriction to the actual range and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> is the inclusion into the original codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-range","status":"resolved","id":"9a8f01bfcbcdc014","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-range]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RangeFactorization}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}range\\text{-}factorization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RangeFactorization}_S(g,f)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B,R,i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(R,f)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,A,R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;g(x)=f(x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,R,B)\n\\land\\forall y\\in R\\;i(y)=y\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;f(x)=i(g(x))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":1315,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3436","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-set12-range-factorization.md|58-df-zfc-set12-range-factorization]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","9a8f01bfcbcdc014"]}